    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42224" root="وقد" body-key="w">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَائِرُ الوَاقِدَيْنِ</span></b>  (tropical:)  <i>Blind:</i> (A:) by <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الواقدين</span> are
meant <i>the two eyes:</i> El-Aashà says, accord. to
one reading,
“<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَأَتْ رَجُلًا غَائِرَ الوَاقِدَيْنِ</span><br />
”
but the reading commonly known is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الوَافِدَيْنِ</span>.
(JK.)

